# Machine-local overlay — rover

# Copy to AGENTIC.local.md (gitignored) when the active host is configured to
# read it. Do not put credential values here.

- Repo path: <absolute path to this repository on this machine>
- Port registry: <local registry path and rover entry>
- `ROVER_SECRET`: reference only the supported local secret source (for example,
  a user environment variable); never copy its value.
- Live restart method: <gitignored local script or documented command>
